# PART 3 — REPORTING DATA GOVERNANCE, SECURITY, PRIVACY & CONTROL

# Reporting Data Governance

SP-210 Reporting Platform harus memiliki tata kelola Reporting Data yang jelas, terukur, aman, dapat ditelusuri, dan dapat diaudit.

Reporting Data Governance memastikan:

- Reporting Data memiliki Owner
- Reporting Data memiliki Classification
- Reporting Data memiliki Lifecycle
- Reporting Data memiliki Access Policy
- Reporting Data memiliki Quality Standard
- Reporting Data memiliki Retention Policy
- Reporting Data memiliki Audit Trail
- Reporting Data memiliki Security Control

Reporting Data tidak boleh dikelola tanpa ownership dan governance.

---

# Reporting Data Ownership

SP-210 memiliki ownership terhadap:

- Report Definition
- Report Template
- Report Configuration
- Report Parameter
- Report Dataset Reference
- Report Query Reference
- Report Generation Metadata
- Report Schedule Reference
- Report Distribution Reference
- Report Export Reference
- Report Version Reference
- Report Monitoring Reference
- Report Audit Reference

Business Domain tetap memiliki ownership terhadap:

- Business Source Data
- Business Rule
- Business Policy
- Business Decision
- Business Meaning
- Domain-specific Data

SP-210 tidak boleh mengubah Business Source Data tanpa authorization dari pemilik domain.

---

# Reporting Data Classification

Reporting Data harus memiliki classification yang sesuai dengan tingkat sensitivitas dan risiko.

Minimal classification:

- Public
- Internal
- Confidential
- Restricted

Classification harus menentukan:

- Access Policy
- Storage Policy
- Transmission Policy
- Export Policy
- Retention Policy
- Audit Requirement
- Monitoring Requirement

---

# Reporting Data Quality

SP-210 harus mendukung mekanisme untuk menjaga kualitas data Reporting.

Data Quality harus dapat ditelusuri melalui:

- Data Source Reference
- Dataset Definition
- Data Validation
- Data Freshness
- Data Completeness
- Data Accuracy Reference
- Data Consistency
- Data Quality Status

SP-210 tidak boleh menyajikan Reporting Data sebagai authoritative tanpa memiliki reference terhadap sumber data dan status kualitas yang sesuai.

---

# Privacy Control

SP-210 harus menerapkan Privacy by Design untuk Reporting Data yang mengandung Personal Data atau Sensitive Data.

Privacy control harus mencakup:

- Data Minimization
- Purpose Limitation
- Access Control
- Data Masking
- Data Redaction
- Export Control
- Retention Control
- Audit Trail
- Privacy Monitoring

Report yang mengandung Personal Data tidak boleh dapat diakses atau didistribusikan tanpa authorization yang sesuai.

---

# Access Control

Akses terhadap Reporting capability harus menerapkan:

- Authentication
- Authorization
- Role-Based Access Control
- Attribute-Based Access Control where applicable
- Least Privilege
- Segregation of Duties
- Tenant Isolation where applicable
- Resource-Level Authorization

Authorization harus diterapkan pada:

- Report
- Dataset
- Report Parameter
- Report Execution
- Report Artifact
- Report Export
- Report Distribution
- Report Administration

---

# Report Export Security

Report Export harus memiliki security control untuk mencegah unauthorized disclosure.

Control harus mencakup:

- Export Authorization
- File Classification
- Sensitive Data Protection
- Access Expiration where applicable
- Download Audit
- Distribution Audit
- Export Audit
- Secure Storage
- Secure Transmission

---

# Audit & Traceability

SP-210 harus menyediakan audit trail untuk aktivitas penting.

Minimal aktivitas yang dapat diaudit:

- Report Created
- Report Updated
- Report Versioned
- Report Viewed
- Report Generated
- Report Exported
- Report Scheduled
- Report Distributed
- Report Accessed
- Report Configuration Changed
- Report Permission Changed
- Report Deleted
- Report Archived

Audit record harus memiliki informasi yang memungkinkan aktivitas ditelusuri secara end-to-end.

Minimal reference:

- Actor
- Timestamp
- Action
- Resource
- Correlation ID
- Trace ID
- Result
- Source
- Security Context where applicable

---

# Retention & Lifecycle

Reporting Data, Report Definition, Report Artifact, Audit Record, dan Report Metadata harus memiliki lifecycle yang jelas.

Lifecycle minimal:

Create
   ↓
Active
   ↓
Updated / Versioned
   ↓
Archived
   ↓
Retained
   ↓
Disposed

